Package: rsims
Title: Simulation Helpers and Statistical Simulation Datasets
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person(
      given = "Metodi",
      family = "Latinov",
      email = "metodilatinov@abv.bg",
      role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Tools for simulating statistical datasets and building simulation
    studies. Includes helper functions for hierarchical data generation,
    random effects, latent variable models, spline effects, state-space
    processes, and a growing collection of ready-to-use simulation datasets
    for testing statistical models.
Imports:
    MASS
